### Holder endpoints
@host = http://localhost:6969
@credentialId = {{credentialId}}
@envelopePath = ../.tmp/envelope.json

### Login as holder (captures accessToken)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "holder@test.edu",
  "password": "TestPass-123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("authToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### List wallet
GET {{host}}/api/holder/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Add a credential to the wallet (credentialId from issuer flow)
POST {{host}}/api/holder/wallet/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Download the signed envelope (saves to {{envelopePath}} for verification)
### NOTE: >> never overwrites — on re-runs it writes envelope-2.json, envelope-3.json, ...
###       delete ../.tmp/envelope.json first so verifier.http reads the fresh one
GET {{host}}/api/holder/credentials/{{credentialId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

>> {{envelopePath}}

### Download the printable certificate PDF (page 1: certificate + QR; page 2+: issuer-uploaded document)
GET {{host}}/api/holder/credentials/{{credentialId}}/certificate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

>> ../.tmp/certificate.pdf

### Remove a credential from the wallet (after downloads — download requires wallet membership)
DELETE {{host}}/api/holder/wallet/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}